 up a work configuration","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/workforce-optimization-for-it-service-management/setup-work-scheduler.md","line":31},{"title":"Create a Work scheduler card using the Next Experience UI Builder","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/workforce-optimization-for-it-service-management/create-workscheduler-card-wfo-itsm.md","line":32},{"title":"Associate a work scheduler card to the work configuration","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/workforce-optimization-for-it-service-management/associate-card-config-wfo-itsm.md","line":33},{"title":"Assign work based on your teams' skills and capacity","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/workforce-optimization-for-it-service-management/track-tasks-teams-wfo-itsm.md","line":44},{"title":"Activate Work scheduler","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/workforce-optimization-for-it-service-management/activate-configurable-workforce-optimization-itsm.md","line":52},{"title":"Any Work scheduler role","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/workforce-optimization-for-it-service-management/work-scheduler-wfo-itsm-reference.md","line":53},{"title":"Understand components used in Work scheduler in Workforce Optimization for ITSM","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/workforce-optimization-for-it-service-management/work-scheduler-wfo-itsm-reference.md","line":53},{"title":"Work scheduler admin","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/wor